癒える傷を
and the healing wounds,

513
00:36:30,512 --> 00:36:31,612
超えたんでしょ
we've overcome them all, haven't we?

514
00:36:31,612 --> 00:36:36,112
不甲斐ない私でもずっと 歩いてきた道がある
Even for my helpless self, there's a path I've walked down all this time.

515
00:36:36,112 --> 00:36:40,512
つまり どうでもいいことなど何もなかったんだよ
In other words, nothing was ever completely pointless!

516
00:36:40,512 --> 00:36:45,912
私混乱上昇いつだって ここが最前線さ
My confusion is rising, but this is always the front line!

517
00:36:45,912 --> 00:36:50,412
最後まで目を離さないで
Don't take your eyes off me until the very end!

518
